Package: SurvDNN
Type: Package
Title: An Interpretable Deep Learning Framework for Biomarker Discovery
        in Complex Disease Survival Outcomes
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Shiyu Wan
Maintainer: Shiyu Wan <shiyu31@unc.edu>
Description: Code for Enhanced Deep Neural Network and Feature Importance Test for Complex Survival Data.
    Implemented a permutation-based feature importance test for common machine-learning models, including RSF, XGBoost, DeepSurv, and DeepHit. Included SurvDNN, a Cox-based survival DNN augmented by bootstrap aggregating and filtering method.
Imports: survival, MASS, tidyverse, simsurv, deepTL, survivalmodels,
        randomForestSRC, survivalsvm, reticulate, Hmisc, xgboost,
        timeROC
Remotes: ShiyuWAN3/deepTL
Depends: survival, MASS, tidyverse, simsurv, deepTL, survivalmodels,
        randomForestSRC, survivalsvm, reticulate, Hmisc, xgboost,
        timeROC
